	(text "IC has preprogrammed GPIO pin configurations...\nAlternate Function 0 (AF0) pin map is factory default.\nPin config set to AF1 when IC is first booted.\nSchematic GPIO nets will assume AF1.\nTODO: Proof-of-Life by sending command to UART_RX on first boot. should receive ACK on UART_TX\nTODO: verify GPIO0, GPIO1 default internal pull-down\nTODO: verify GPIO[6-18] default internal pull-up"
